          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পাড়ি দেওয়া — pāṛi deoyā — \"to make a crossing (of sea or river); to set out on a long way\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "জাহাজটা সাত দিনে সমুদ্র পাড়ি দিল। jāhājṭā sāt dine sômudrô pāṛi dilô. The ship crossed the sea in seven days."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): সেই জাহাজ সমুদ্র পাড়ি দিল, sei jāhāj sômudrô pāṛi dilô."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A word with distance in it: you পাড়ি দাও across an ocean, or to a far city."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পাড়ি দেওয়া (pāṛi deoyā) joins পাড়ি, \"a crossing, a long passage\", to দেওয়া, to give; the origin of পাড়ি is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
